WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.598
Onon ɓiɓɓe lesdi Gulmu, nana ko yimɓe ardiiɓe mbi'i dow fuunaaŋge leydi ndii, to Fada N'Gurma.

00:00:07.678 --> 00:00:16.174
O fuɗɗii nder sahaa nde yimɓe walaa laamiiɗo, koo to saare woodi umrooje muuɗum'en, e haɓre walaa keerol.

00:00:16.254 --> 00:00:20.912
Gooto ɗon wi'a, nyalnde go'oto, asama maɓɓiti dow saafana.

00:00:20.992 --> 00:00:24.587
Sey goɗɗo ƴiwoyi e yimɓe maako e jawdi maako.

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:26.956
Innde maako woni Diaba Lompo.

00:00:27.036 --> 00:00:32.265
Yimɓe ɗon mbi'a dow ko'e maɓɓe, ɓe mbaɗata haala dow no ɓe njahi.

00:00:32.345 --> 00:00:37.656
Gooto fuu e woodi haala maako, nden kam ɗum woni ko yimɓe mbi'ata.

00:00:37.736 --> 00:00:44.681
Nder ummaatoore Mossi, haala feere waɗi o ɓiɗɗo laamiiɗo Yennenga e mawɗo leñol Rialé.

00:00:44.761 --> 00:00:47.948
Yimɓe gariiri ndin huli o wari daga dow.

00:00:48.028 --> 00:00:50.643
Ammaa Diaba Lompo warataa e konu.

00:00:50.723 --> 00:00:55.136
O nani haala yimɓe, o waɗi kiita e faamu, o wurtini ɓe.

00:00:55.216 --> 00:01:03.385
Ɓaawo maajum yimɓe ngari haa maako ngam ɓe ngaɗana ko o wi'i, ngam maajum wolde maako laati tawreeta.

00:01:03.465 --> 00:01:05.346
O waɗi kuugal dow lesdi.

00:01:05.426 --> 00:01:09.266
O waɗi mawɓe nder gure, o waɗi umrooje e kuugal.

00:01:09.346 --> 00:01:13.595
O hokki ɓikkoy maako kuugal laamiiɓe dow diiwaanuuji.

00:01:13.675 --> 00:01:17.924
Ngam maajum laamiiɗo Gulmu, lesdi Goormanke'en, ummi.

00:01:18.004 --> 00:01:25.112
E wiyde aada, laamiiɓe Gulmu ƴiwoyi diga Diaba Lompo, e jooɗorgal maɓɓe e Fada N'Gourma.

00:01:25.192 --> 00:01:37.037
Ko haalaaji ɗii mbi'i, naa' ko haala neɗɗo mo ƴiwoyi dow kammu tan, ammaa ko haala ummaatooje goɗɗe, ko haala goɗɗe e umrooje ɗe yimɓe fuu jaɓata.

00:01:37.117 --> 00:01:47.247
To on ƴami ardiiɓe on, to ɓe mbi'i: "Ɗum woni goonga?" Ɓe mbi'a: "Kuuje ɗon haa dow, ammaa taariika ɗon haa hakkunde meeɗen".
